# Photo Booth takes the camera: Gzyms names it from Control Center's line in the system log.
# That line is not a promise from Apple, so a macOS update can change it or hide the app as <private>.
# Control Center logs a change ~4 s late, hence the wait after the first quit. Other apps may hold the camera or mic too, so only Photo Booth's own id must be in the list.
> quit com.apple.PhotoBooth
> idle 8
> open com.apple.PhotoBooth
sensors: camera [<*>"com.apple.PhotoBooth"<*>], mic <*>
> quit com.apple.PhotoBooth
sensors: camera <*>, mic <*>
